    feat2Desc: "Trained on your room types, rates, amenities, cancellation policies, and nearby dining recommendations from your Google Place ID. Zero hallucinated answers.",
    feat3Title: "Auto-Detected Multilingual Concierge",
    feat3Desc: "Instantly responds in English, Mandarin, Japanese, German, French, Korean, and more without requiring guests to manually select a language.",
    feat4Title: "Closed-Loop GA4 & Ads Conversion Attribution",
